    "title": "Lesson 70: Common BSOD Stop Codes: IRQL_NOT_LESS_OR_EQUAL, KERNEL_SECURITY_CHECK_FAILURE",
    "slug": "it-lesson-70-common-bsod-stop-codes-irql-not-less-or-equal-kernel-security-check-failure",
    "category": "computer_skills",
    "track": "it_skills",
