    "category_name": "Computer & IT Skills",
    "difficulty": "Intermediate",
    "summary": "Remove pre-installed promotional apps, disable background telemetry data uploads, and maximize usable RAM.",
    "content": "# Lesson 75: Eliminating Windows Telemetry & Background Bloatware: Safe PowerShell Debloating\n\nWelcome to **Lesson 75** of the Computer & IT Skills Mastery Curriculum at Bargisy eSchool! In this lesson, you will master **Eliminating Windows Telemetry & Background Bloatware: Safe PowerShell Debloating**.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Technical Concepts & Enterprise Fundamentals\nRemove pre-installed promotional apps, disable background telemetry data uploads, and maximize usable RAM.\n\nA top-tier IT professional must possess practical, hands-on diagnostics and troubleshooting skills. Whether managing hundreds of corporate workstations or optimizing your personal computer, understanding operating system internals, hardware health, network routing, and security postures is vital.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Practical IT Diagnostic Implementation\nReview and practice these command line utilities, administrative workflows, and diagnostic procedures:\n\n```powershell\n# Remove non-essential provisioned AppX packages for all new user profiles\nGet-AppxProvisionedPackage -Online | Where-Object DisplayName -like \"*XboxGamingOverlay*\" | Remove-AppxProvisionedPackage -Online\n```\n\n---\n\n> [!TIP]\n> **Enterprise IT Best Practice**: Always verify backups, test theories systematically before applying major system modifications, and document every resolution step clearly!\n\n---\n\n## 3. Hands-on Student Challenge\nSolidify your knowledge by completing this field scenario challenge:\n1. **Objective**: Safely audit provisioned modern apps on a fresh Windows workstation using Get-AppxPackage.\n2. Open your terminal or diagnostic tools.\n3. Execute the procedure, record your output, and verify that your system is functioning optimally!\n",
    "tags": "IT Skills, Lesson 75, Hardware, Networking, Troubleshooting, Cybersecurity, Intermediate",
    "read_time": 5,
    "author": "Mohammed Bargisy",
    "status": "published",
    "views": 195,
