    "content": "# Lesson 80: Comprehensive PC Tune-up Protocol: The 10-Step IT Checklist for Reviving Aging Laptops\n\nWelcome to **Lesson 80** of the Computer & IT Skills Mastery Curriculum at Bargisy eSchool! In this lesson, you will master **Comprehensive PC Tune-up Protocol: The 10-Step IT Checklist for Reviving Aging Laptops**.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Technical Concepts & Enterprise Fundamentals\nExecute a standardized multi-point tune-up: disk health, temp clean, startup audit, malware scan, sfc, update, thermal check.\n\nA top-tier IT professional must possess practical, hands-on diagnostics and troubleshooting skills. Whether managing hundreds of corporate workstations or optimizing your personal computer, understanding operating system internals, hardware health, network routing, and security postures is vital.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Practical IT Diagnostic Implementation\nReview and practice these command line utilities, administrative workflows, and diagnostic procedures:\n\n```powershell\n# The Bargisy eSchool 10-Step PC Tune-Up Protocol:\n# 1. Check S.M.A.R.T. disk health -> 2. Clean %temp% & cleanmgr -> 3. Run SFC/DISM\n# 4. Audit Task Manager Startup -> 5. Uninstall bloatware -> 6. Scan with Malwarebytes\n# 7. Update OS & Drivers -> 8. Clean heatsink dust -> 9. Optimize Pagefile -> 10. Verify reboot time\n```\n\n---\n\n> [!TIP]\n> **Enterprise IT Best Practice**: Always verify backups, test theories systematically before applying major system modifications, and document every resolution step clearly!\n\n---\n\n## 3. Hands-on Student Challenge\nSolidify your knowledge by completing this field scenario challenge:\n1. **Objective**: Apply the 10-step tune-up protocol on an aging family or office laptop and document before/after boot times.\n2. Open your terminal or diagnostic tools.\n3. Execute the procedure, record your output, and verify that your system is functioning optimally!\n",
    "tags": "IT Skills, Lesson 80, Hardware, Networking, Troubleshooting, Cybersecurity, Intermediate",
